OL,3,GNEWSAFood store and drive-thru plans
OL,4,Aconsidered
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new food store could be built in a
OL,7,Ftown in West Sussex as part of plans
OL,8,Fthe developer says will reduce the
OL,9,Fnumber of longer journeys residents
OL,10,Fcurrently make elsewhere.
OL,12,FLandlink's proposal would see the
OL,13,Fstore, and a drive-thru, developed
OL,14,Fadjacent to the ASDA and Costa at Wave
OL,15,FApproach in Selsey.
OL,17,FA drop-in session is being held at
OL,18,FSelsey Town Hall on Wednesday to
OL,19,Fdiscuss the proposal.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
