OL,3,GNEWSAFood store and drive-thru plans
OL,4,Aconsidered
OL,5,
OL,6,FJacintha Carty, property director of
OL,7,FLandlink, said: "The feedback we
OL,8,Freceive will help us shape our
OL,9,Fproposals as they evolve, before we
OL,10,Fsubmit our planning application. We
OL,11,Flook forward to meeting with the
OL,12,Fcommunity."
